    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on levin-2022-tame-26: partially-resolvable, resolvability 0.71";
    dc:description "Public comparative resources can robustly test channel antiquity and temporal association with metazoan diversification. The functional and cognitive interpretation remains underdetermined, making the full claim only partially resolvable.";
    dc:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/dataset-resolvability-0.2.0>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Date duplications and domain innovations in context-sensitive ion-channel families on a species tree, then test their association with independently coded body-plan complexity while controlling phylogeny and genome quality.";
